    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperbly presented one-bedroom apartment positioned one the second floor with one underground car space.\n\nSavills is delighted to present No. 17 The Telford Building to the market. A bright and contemporary one-bedroom apartment ideally positioned on the second floor of this highly sought-after development in the heart of HSQ, Dublin 8.\n\nThis modern apartment extends to a well-proportioned layout and offers modern city living within one of Dublin's most vibrant neighbourhoods. The accommodation comprises an inviting entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a contemporary kitchen fitted with a range of integrated appliances, a generous double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, and a well-appointed bathroom.\n\nA particular feature of the property is the private balcony, providing an excellent outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining. Large windows throughout allow for an abundance of natural light, enhancing the sense of space and comfort.\n\nThe property further benefits from a designated underground car parking space, a highly valuable feature in this central city location.\n\nNo. 17 The Telford represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, owner-occupiers and investors alike seeking a modern apartment in a thriving city location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Second-floor one-bedroom apartment</li><li>Bright and spacious accommodation throughout</li><li>Private balcony</li><li>Designated underground parking space</li><li>Modern kitchen and bathroom fittings</li><li>Excellent transport connections</li><li>Walking distance to Dublin city centre</li><li>Located within the highly desirable HSQ development</li><li>Close to St. James's Hospital and the National Children's Hospital</li><li>Ideal for owner-occupiers and investors alike</ul>"
      },
